# The packages of other publishers the core's scripts run, installed from .packages/package-lock.json, and the code
# scan's engine from .packages/requirements.txt, by scripts/install.mjs: never tracked, here or in a project's copy,
# where this file stands at the copy's root (#654), nor a link in their place; nor the folder an install before they moved into .packages/ left at the root, which a clone
# made then still holds. The copy's package list, lock files and .npmrc, in the dot folder .packages/ so that no
# workspace pattern of a project's own package list takes them in, are tracked there even where the project's own
# .gitignore leaves such files, or dot folders, out.
!/.packages/
/.packages/node_modules
/.packages/pypi
/node_modules
!/.packages/.npmrc
!/.packages/package.json
!/.packages/package-lock.json
!/.packages/requirements.txt
